{
  "repo": "microsoft/BotFramework-WebChat",
  "number": 5908,
  "title": "Make the snapshots of recently added html2 tests easier to review",
  "body": "> Make the snapshots of recently added html2 tests easier to review.\n\n## Changelog Entry\n\nNot required, development only.\n\n## Description\n\nSome recently added keyboard tests skipped snapshots between key presses, and some snapshots did not say what they show. Keyboard tests now snapshot every key press, each snapshot follows a `// THEN:` comment describing it, and the send box is hidden where it is not under test.\n\n## Specific Changes\n\n- `carousel/flipperButton.focusVisible`, `richCard/heroCard.pushButton.focusVisible`, `richCard/animationCard.gif`: snapshot the focused element before the next key, hide the send box\n- `richCard/animationCard.gif.forcedColors` (and `.fluent`): forced colors split out of `animationCard.gif`\n- `suggestedActions/suggestedActions.flipperButton.focusVisible`, `transcript/navigation/visualKeyboardIndicator.styleOptions`: one SHIFT-TAB per step, snapshot after each\n- `richCard/receiptCard.textSpacing`, `richCard/mediaCard.mediaList`, `markdown/codeBlock/remount`, `markdown/codeBlock/contrast`, `activity/programmingLanguageTitle`: `// THEN:` describes each snapshot, samples next to their assertions\n- `carousel/navigation.arrowKeys*`: snapshot after every key, assert the settled position; split `formControls` into `cards`, `submitButton`, `heroCardButton` (the input case asserts the caret after every key)\n- `pageConditions.carouselSettled`, `testHelpers.isCardInView`, `testHelpers.isFlipperHidden`: replace copies in the carousel tests\n\n- [x] I have added tests and executed them locally\n- [ ] I have updated `CHANGELOG.md`\n- [ ] I have updated documentation\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n> This section is for contributors to review your work.\n\n- [ ] Accessibility reviewed (tab order, content readability, alt text, color contrast)\n- [ ] Browser and platform compatibilities reviewed\n- [ ] CSS styles reviewed (minimal rules, no `z-index`)\n- [ ] Documents reviewed (docs, samples, live demo)\n- [ ] Internationalization reviewed (strings, unit formatting)\n- [ ] `package.json` and `package-lock.json` reviewed\n- [ ] Security reviewed (no data URIs, check for nonce leak)\n- [ ] Tests reviewed (coverage, legitimacy)\n\n",
